I guess I'll have
my stuff picked up.

525
00:21:37,671 --> 00:21:40,507
Yeah, okay.

526
00:21:43,052 --> 00:21:46,764
Okay, so, uh...

527
00:21:58,442 --> 00:22:01,112
Good-bye.

528
00:22:03,447 --> 00:22:04,406
Take it easy, Mike.

529
00:22:04,448 --> 00:22:05,866
Good luck.
Bye, Mike.

530
00:22:05,908 --> 00:22:07,201
See you
later, Mike.
Bye-bye, now.

531
00:22:11,038 --> 00:22:12,706
I'm so sorry,
Pheebs.

532
00:22:12,748 --> 00:22:14,125
We're all sorry.

533
00:22:18,963 --> 00:22:20,714
Look on the bright side,

534
00:22:20,756 --> 00:22:24,093
I mean, at least you won't have
to live with this ugly chair.

535
00:22:24,135 --> 00:22:26,929
That was here already, huh?

536
00:22:26,971 --> 00:22:28,222
I love you.

537
00:22:30,808 --> 00:22:31,809
( kissing )

538
00:22:39,357 --> 00:22:41,027
Aah! I did it!

539
00:22:41,068 --> 00:22:42,153
I did it! Ha-ha!

540
00:22:42,195 --> 00:22:43,696
All right.

541
00:22:49,827 --> 00:22:53,122
I better take all I can carry.

542
00:22:53,164 --> 00:22:56,625
Who knows when I'll be able
to get in here again, huh?

543
00:22:56,667 --> 00:23:06,760
